            "relation": "IMPACTED_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "Southern California",
            "target_entity_type": "Country_Subdivision",
            "paragraph": "As an example, the recent ~ 20-year-cooling trend in the eastern tropical Pacific has been linked to the generation of massive droughts in Southern California, an intensification of Pacific trade winds and accelerated sea-level rise in the western tropical Pacific.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
